  "brief": "<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> Market Overview</h2>\n\nMixed pre-market action with tech getting hammered while defensives find buyers amid Iran war escalation. VIX cooling off to 27.78 suggests some complacency creeping back despite geopolitical chaos. Oil supply concerns driving clear rotation into energy and healthcare while growth takes a backseat.\n\n<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> What to Watch</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PPI Data (12:30 ET)</strong> - Core PPI could move the Fed needle with inflation still a wildcard</li>\n<li><strong>MBA Mortgage Data (11:00 ET)</strong> - Housing market stress test with rates elevated</li>\n<li><strong>Oil Supply Dynamics</strong> - IEA warning of supply plunge below demand could spike crude further</li>\n<li><strong>Hormuz Shipping Routes</strong> - Any disruption headlines will move energy and transport names fast</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> Sector Rotation</h2>\n\nClassic risk-off rotation in play with healthcare (+1.96%) and staples (+1.28%) leading while tech bleeds (-1.51%). Energy holding strong (+0.70%) on supply shock fears, but this rotation could reverse quickly if geopolitical tensions ease. Small caps getting destroyed (-0.97%) as money flows to defensive large caps.\n\n<div class=\"callout callout-amber\"><div class=\"callout-label\">⚡ Key Driver</div>Iran conflict escalation creating oil supply shock fears. IEA warning of demand exceeding supply this year could sustain energy rally and pressure growth stocks.</div>\n\n<div class=\"callout callout-red\"><div class=\"callout-label\">⚠ Bear Case</div>Tech weakness with QQQ down -0.85% pre-market signals growth concerns. If PPI runs hot, Fed stays hawkish and multiples compress further.</div>\n\n<div class=\"callout callout-green\"><div class=\"callout-label\">✦ Bull Case</div>VIX dropping suggests panic selling overdone. Defensive rotation creates oversold bounce opportunities in beaten-down growth names.</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> Levels That Matter</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SPY 735</strong> - Pre-market support holding, break below targets 728</li>\n<li><strong>QQQ 700</strong> - Psychological level, failure opens 690-685 zone</li>\n<li><strong>VIX 30</strong> - Back above signals real fear, below 25 confirms calm</li>\n<li><strong>XLE 95</strong> - Energy breakout level, oil supply concerns could push higher</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n<p><em>Not a prediction. A preparation. Make your plan before the bell.</em></p>"
